	(lib_symbols)
	(text "8. ANALOG & DIGITAL POWER RAIL ISOLATION (FB1 REMOVAL / POINT 13)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n• Topology Correction: Removed FB1 bridging resistor between +3.3V and +3.3VA.\n• Independent Regulation: Buck-boost converters U2 (+3.3V) and U3 (+3.3VA) operate \n  with complete physical and electrical isolation, preventing high-frequency digital \n  switching noise from polluting the precision analog reference plane.\n\n\n9. EC COUPLING CAPACITOR UPGRADE (C28 / POINT 07)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n• Capacitance Upgrade: C28 increased to 100 µF (1206 MLCC, >= 6.3V rating).\n• Impedance Optimization: Lowers 16 Hz AC capacitive reactance (Xc) down to ~99.5 Ω, \n  eliminating signal attenuation across high-impedance liquid/soil probes.\n\n\n10. ONE-WIRE TEMP SENSOR PULL-UP & GROUND CORRECTION (POINTS 08, 09, 11, 15)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n• Bus Pull-Up: Integrated dedicated 4.7 kΩ pull-up resistor (R61) between \n  DS18B20_DATA (GPIO6) and +3.3V rail to ensure reliable 1-Wire communication.\n• Net Re-routing: C22 ground pin re-routed from digital GNDA to the continuous \n  unified Layer 2 ground plane (GND).\n• Local Decoupling: Localized 100 nF ceramic decoupling capacitor (C48) placed \n  directly adjacent to OPA2320 (U13) Pin 10 (+3.3VA) and GND.\n================================================================================"
